OL,3,GNEWSAVillagers 'delighted' as bus
OL,4,Aservice reinstated
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bus route which was previously
OL,7,Fcancelled will now be reintroduced, to
OL,8,Fthe delight of villagers.
OL,10,FThe 300 bus route, linking villages
OL,11,Fbetween Lowdham and Newark, stopped
OL,12,Frunning in August, when former operator
OL,13,FCommunity Transport for Nottingham
OL,14,F(CT4N) announced steps were being take
OL,15,Fto place the firm into administration.
OL,17,FResidents had campaigned for the route
OL,18,Fto be reinstated, saying some people
OL,19,Fhad been "cut off".
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
